1
00:00:00,580 --> 00:00:02,350
(Raj:)You said I could
buy a desk.

2
00:00:02,350 --> 00:00:04,490
This isn't a desk.

3
00:00:04,490 --> 00:00:08,420
(Sheldon:)This is a...
Brobdingnagian
monstrosity.

4
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:10,390
(Raj:)Is that the American idiom

5
00:00:10,390 --> 00:00:13,300
for "giant, big-ass desk"?

6
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:16,130
(Sheldon:)It's actually British.

7
00:00:16,130 --> 00:00:17,770
(Raj:)Can you say it again for me?

8
00:00:17,770 --> 00:00:19,370
(Sheldon:)Brobdingnagian.

9
00:00:19,370 --> 00:00:20,470
(Raj:)One more time?

10
00:00:20,470 --> 00:00:22,740
(Sheldon:)Brobdingnagian.

11
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:24,140
(Raj:)Now three times fast?

12
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:26,140
(Sheldon:)Brobdingnagian, Brobdingna...

13
00:00:29,610 --> 00:00:31,410
(Sheldon:)How did you even
get it in here?

14
00:00:31,410 --> 00:00:34,720
(Raj:)That's for me, Ramon, Julio,
Jesus and Rodrigo to know

15
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:36,280
(Raj:)and you to find out.

16
00:00:36,290 --> 00:00:39,850
(Sheldon:)All right, you've
made your point.

17
00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:42,720
(Sheldon:)A fine prank, very amusing.

18
00:00:42,730 --> 00:00:45,230
(Sheldon:)Now get it out.

19
00:00:45,230 --> 00:00:46,630
(Raj:)No.

20
00:00:46,630 --> 00:00:47,830
(Sheldon:)Yes.

21
00:00:47,830 --> 00:00:48,830
(Sheldon:)Yes.
No.

22
00:00:48,830 --> 00:00:50,430
Yes!
I have three brothers

23
00:00:50,430 --> 00:00:53,200
(Raj:)and two sisters, Sheldon--
I can do this all day.

24
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:55,900
(Sheldon:)All right, if you're
not going to remove it,

25
00:00:55,910 --> 00:00:57,510
(Sheldon:)I'll remove it for you.

